[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "What does 'a cold welcome' refer to?",
    "start": 13.231,
    "end": 18.293,
    "zh": "“冷漠的欢迎”指的是什么？",
    "zh_hant": "“冷漠的歡迎”指的是什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "On Wednesday evening, we went to the Town Hall.",
    "start": 20.755,
    "end": 24.456,
    "zh": "星期三晚上，我们去了市政厅。",
    "zh_hant": "星期三晚上，我們去了市政廳。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "It was the last day of the year",
    "start": 25.217,
    "end": 27.658,
    "zh": "那是一年的最后一天",
    "zh_hant": "那是一年的最後一天"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "and a large crowd of people had gathered under the Town Hall clock.",
    "start": 27.798,
    "end": 32.96,
    "zh": "一大群人聚集在市政厅的大钟下面。",
    "zh_hant": "一大群人聚集在市政廳的大鐘下面。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "It would strike twelve in twenty minutes' time.",
    "start": 34.421,
    "end": 38.223,
    "zh": "再过二十分钟，它就要敲响十二点了。",
    "zh_hant": "再過二十分鐘，它就要敲響十二點了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Fifteen minutes passed and then,",
    "start": 39.104,
    "end": 42.185,
    "zh": "十五分钟过去了，然后",
    "zh_hant": "十五分鐘過去了，然後"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "at five to twelve, the clock stopped.",
    "start": 42.646,
    "end": 46.407,
    "zh": "在十二点差五分时，钟停了。",
    "zh_hant": "在十二點差五分時，鐘停了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "The big minute hand did not move.",
    "start": 47.748,
    "end": 51.81,
    "zh": "巨大的分针没有动。",
    "zh_hant": "巨大的分針沒有動。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "We waited and waited, but nothing happened.",
    "start": 52.491,
    "end": 56.734,
    "zh": "我们等了又等，但什么都没发生。",
    "zh_hant": "我們等了又等，但什麼都沒發生。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "Suddenly someone shouted.",
    "start": 57.655,
    "end": 59.916,
    "zh": "突然有人大声喊道。",
    "zh_hant": "突然有人大聲喊道。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "'It's two minutes past twelve!",
    "start": 59.566,
    "end": 64.258,
    "zh": "“已经十二点过两分了！",
    "zh_hant": "“已經十二點過兩分了！"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "The clock has stopped!'",
    "start": 64.459,
    "end": 67.48,
    "zh": "钟停了！",
    "zh_hant": "鐘停了！"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "I looked at my watch.",
    "start": 68.742,
    "end": 70.262,
    "zh": "我看了看手表。",
    "zh_hant": "我看了看手錶。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "It was true.",
    "start": 70.263,
    "end": 71.383,
    "zh": "确实如此。",
    "zh_hant": "確實如此。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "The big clock refused to welcome the New Year.",
    "start": 71.784,
    "end": 75.886,
    "zh": "那座大钟拒绝迎接新年的到来。",
    "zh_hant": "那座大鐘拒絕迎接新年的到來。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "At that moment, everybody began to laugh and sing.",
    "start": 76.847,
    "end": 82.29,
    "zh": "那一刻，大家都开始又笑又唱。",
    "zh_hant": "那一刻，大家都開始又笑又唱。"
  }
]
